          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संयोग — saṁyog — \"a coincidence\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "क्या संयोग है, हम दोनों का जन्मदिन एक ही दिन है! Kyā saṁyog hai, ham donõ kā janmdin ek hī din hai! What a coincidence: we both have our birthday on the same day!"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संयोग (saṁyog) is a tatsama, taken whole from Sanskrit saṃyoga, \"conjunction, connection\" (Monier-Williams). Hindi uses it for things that come together by chance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
